#sortorder:10
#showas:黑暗联盟
This scenario features the many aspects of the Dark Zenith. The Ragnarok AI (diff 7) heavily prefers using DZ units. 

You start with DZ Svikari (intensity 5) as an ally, which needs sufficient territory to flourish.

The Dark Alliance is a team made up of the Dark Spire (intensity 3) and Dark Zenith (intensity 5). The Dark Zenith will invade the galaxy from their own homeworlds roughly 90 minutes into the game. These are formidable adversaries, but winning isn't contingent on their defeat. Nonetheless, it may be worthwhile to deal with them first as their homeworlds are rich in AIP-free science and alien technology. Consider making your own counter-invasion, sneaking into their homeworlds in a pincer movement while the AI fights on the frontlines.